      "name": "commission_rate",
      "in": "body",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "- 佣金率筛选，可指定佣金范围，支持如下格式\n  - 0,5\n  - 10,20\n  - 20,30\n  - 30,40\n  - 40,50\n  - 50,-1",
      "example": "10",
      "_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "order_by",
      "in": "body",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "asc:升序，desc:降序，默认desc",
      "example": "desc",
      "_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "month_sales",
      "in": "body",
      "type": "mixed",
      "required": false,
      "description": "- 月销筛选，可筛选月销满足要求的商品，支持如下格式\n  - 1  含义是>=5千\n  - 2  含义是>=1万\n  - 3  含义是>=2万\n  - 4  含义是>=3万\n  - 5  含义是>=5万",
      "example": "-1",
      "_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "query_info",
      "in": "body",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "可指定商品信息/店铺信息查询",
      "example": "衣服",
      "_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "shop_score",
      "in": "body",
      "type": "mixed",
      "required": false,
      "description": "- 店铺分筛选，可筛选店铺分达标的商品，支持如下格式\n  - 1  含义是>=80分\n  - 2  含义是>=85分\n  - 3  含义是>=90分\n  - 4  含义是>=95分\n  - 5  含义是=100分",
      "example": "-1",
      "_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "cat_id",
      "in": "body",
      "type": "mixed",
      "required": false,
      "description": "行业类目筛选，可指定电商行业大类id",
      "example": "-1",
      "_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "order_field",
      "in": "body",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "- 排序字段，支持如下四种排序\n  - product_price\n  - commission_rate\n  - month_sales\n  - promoters_count",
      "example": "product_price",
      "_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "page",
      "in": "body",
      "type": "mixed",
      "required": false,
      "description": "默认1",
      "example": "1",
      "_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "product_price",
      "in": "body",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "- 商品价格筛选，可指定价格范围，支持如下格式\n  - 0,10\n  - 10,30\n  - 30,50\n  - 50,100\n  - 100,500\n  - 500,-1",
      "example": "-1",
      "_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "service_rate",
      "in": "body",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "- 服务费率筛选，可指定服务费范围，支持如下格式\n  - 0,3\n  - 3,5\n  - 5,8\n  - 10,-1",
      "example": "-1",
      "_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "promote_time",
      "in": "body",
      "type": "mixed",
      "required": false,
      "description": "- 可合作时间筛选，可指定合作到期时间范围，支持如下格式\n  - 0  含义是>=7天\n  - 1  含义是>=30天\n  - 2  含义是>=90天\n  - 3  含义是>=180天\n  - 4  含义是>=360天",
      "example": "-1",
      "_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "promoters_count",
      "in": "body",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "- 带货达人数筛选，可筛选商品的带货达人数量，支持如下格式\n  - 100 含义是>=100个达人\n  - 200 含义是>=200个达人\n  - 500 含义是>=500个达人\n  - 1000 含义是>=1000个达人",
      "example": "-1",
      "_depth": 0
    }
  ],
